{"kind": "plan", "reply": "Putting the whole ₱25,050.00 surplus on the card would clear it in 3 months instead of 7 months, and card interest would drop to ₱4,620.01 from ₱9,358.80. That's a real saving. But for those months the emergency fund and the House fund would get nothing, and the House fund would fall off track.

